104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"Chang the Ninth","textMapHash":4189509188,"text":"I believe the name is... \"This Novel is Amazing!\" More importantly, the competition is hosted by the Yae Publishing House, a giant of the Inazuma publishing industry.","nextNodeIds":[223020105]},{"nodeId":223020105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"Chang the Ninth","textMapHash":2029860364,"text":"I prepared for this competition by immersing myself in some Inazuma popular fiction to get a sense of what they like over there.","nextNodeIds":[223020106]},{"nodeId":223020106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"Chang the Ninth","textMapHash":2375714868,"text":"Of course, I also have an entire study full of literature and I've read every single book in there at some point in my life. So for my entry, I wrote a novel that integrates the best of Liyue and Inazuma culture. This one is a winner, I'm sure of it!","nextNodeIds":[223020107]},{"nodeId":223020107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"Chang the Ninth","textMapHash":4143380772,"text":"I spoke with the Feiyun Commerce Guild. They are sending someone to take my entry to Inazuma and submit it in person. However, that someone has so far failed to show up!","nextNodeIds":[223020108]},{"nodeId":223020108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"Chang the Ninth","textMapHash":4183391020,"text":"I need you to deliver the manuscript to the <color=#00E1FFFF>Feiyun Commerce Guild</color> for me. Do you have the time?","nextNodeIds":[223020109,223020111]},{"nodeId":223020109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3053916300,"text":"Sure.","nextNodeIds":[223020110]},{"nodeId":223020110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"Chang the Ninth","textMapHash":722632724,"text":"That's the spirit. Go and make me a winner!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":223020111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2017311676,"text":"What's your story about?","nextNodeIds":[223020112]},{"nodeId":223020112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"Chang the Ninth","textMapHash":3418373532,"text":"This is a competition. Sorry, but I am not about to let you in on the details of my entry.","nextNodeIds":[223020113]},{"nodeId":223020113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"Chang the Ninth","textMapHash":3641962140,"text":"If I can just win this, everything will start to improve...","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2230201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_UI","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["1624"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2230202,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Take the book to Feiyun Commerce Guild","stepDescTextMapHash":4122045102,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1165,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_TRIGGER_FIRE","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q22302FYSH"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[2230202,2230204],"talks":[{"talkId":2230202,"talkConfig